SELECTIVE REUSE AND IMPLEMENTATION REFERENCES

- gradlew was copied from PokeDaisy's checkout. The Windows launcher is new;
  gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar is the official wrapper JAR packaged in
  Gradle 8.10.2. Gradle wrapper code is licensed under Apache License 2.0.
- The Android/Gradle dependency versions and minimal mGBA build configuration
  follow the working PokeDaisy build. This project omits its DS, Pokemon,
  achievements, network and analytics integrations.
- The host implementation is independently scoped for GBA. Its design follows
  PokeDaisy's documented frame-boundary memory capture, emulator-thread ownership,
  Presentation display handling, input release on focus changes, and native
  framebuffer lifetime rules. Relevant upstream files are EmulatorEngine.kt,
  EmulatorView.kt, DualScreenPresentation.kt, Screens.kt, GbaInput.kt,
  companion/data/MemoryReader.kt and app/src/main/cpp/pokedaisy_jni.c.
  Exact code excerpts adapted in this checkout must also retain their source
  attribution in the implementing file or the project's reuse register.

